 document also indicates the Work Item code(s) to be used when submitting CRs for NR bands and 5G NR CADC configurations depending on the target power class. The worksheets "NR bands" and "5G NR CADC Configurations" include lists showing the current status for RAN5 NR bands, NR band CBW extensions and 5G NR CADC configurations for power class 3 (PC3) and applicable additional power classes (e.g. PC1.5 and PC2). The list shows for each NR band, NR band CBW extensions and 5G NR CADC configuration the declared interested operator and the company that have been assigned taking for adding necessary details to 3GPP RAN5 UE conformance test specifications for PC3. Interested operator for other power than PC3 is tracked within the specific work plan of the power class. The list also shows the Work Item code (s) to be used when submitting CRs for the different NR bands and 5G NR CADC configurations for the different power classes. The status is updated after each RAN5 meeting. The NR bands and 5G NR CADC configurations worksheets provides tools to select one or more NR bands/5G NR CADC configurations for the purpose to request assignment as interested operator and/or responsible company of NR bands, NR band CBW extensions and 5G NR CADC configuration(s). For guideline how to use the NR bands and 5G NR CADC configurations worksheets see the PRD21 word document. Table 2: Worksheet name | Description Introduction | Description of PRD21 NR bands and 5G NR CADC configurations list and statistics of number of NR bands, NR band extension items and 5G NR CADC configurations. NR bands | List of NR bands and NR band CBW extension items and their status 5G NR CADC configurations | List of 5G NR CADC configurations and their status

